{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/29106-custom-token-the-kreigsmariner-s-canteen","id":29106,"title":"Custom Token: The Kreigsmariner's Canteen","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-12T19:54:22-08:00","id":29106,"title":"Custom Token: The Kreigsmariner's Canteen","content":"I've made a token and I'd like some input on if it's balanced and how many dots it should cost. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">The Kreigsmariner's Canteen (Dots TBD)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Verdana, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">In July 1944 the U-493 sank an oil tanker, the USS Sophie Antoinette, off the coast of Florida. Minutes later the destroyer USS Roland Jones sank the U-493 off the coast of Florida. The only survivors of the two sunken vessels were Karl Werk and the Bakelite canteen attached to his belt. He escaped from the doomed submarine, exhausted himself swimming to the surface, and soon found himself on a beach filled with oil, debris, and an open fire pit. Karl was soon put to work putting metal, human remains, and oil-drenched sand into the pit. Karl wasn't able to survive the week. He and his canteen were tossed into the flames. Somehow the canteen survived. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Verdana, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">People who drink any amount of salt-water from the canteen are granted a measure of protection from fire. This water has a horrible oil-like taste and smell. That's not the true cost of invoking the protection. The drinker spends the next thirty minute reliving Karl's last few days starting with the sighting of the Sophie Antoinette and ending with his body being thrown into the fire pit. Anyone who drank the water will spend the rest of the day in a state of pain, misery, and exhaustion. </span></span><span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">After a full night of rest they drinker remembers that they had a horrible experience after drinking the water but they won't recall any other details.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Ability: The user is protected from fire for the rest of the scene, taking bashing damage instead of lethal damage. Burns and blisters become bumps and bruises. The canteen itself is impervious to fire.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Action: Instant.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Mask: </span></span><a href=\"http://www.ebay.com/itm/WW2-GERMAN-BAKELITE-German-WAFFEN-ZZ-DAK-soldiers-field-CANTEEN-BOTTLE-AFRIKA-/111235308896\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.ebay.com/itm/WW2-GERMAN-...A-/111235308896</a><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Mein: When the canteen is activated the it starts to seep tears. When it's opened the canteen starts to scream.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Catch: The user has to spend one willpower to drink the water and rolls -1 until they're able to get a full-nights rest. </span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1477-randompaul","name":"Randompaul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T02:01:23-08:00","id":29207,"title":"","content":"Probably 1 dot, if only because a 1 dot Contract of Elements grants you 